# The toolchain images this tree builds with, pinned by digest. The one
# place that names them: toolchain/image.sh reads this file for the shell
# scripts, and the Makefiles include it. Plain KEY=value lines only, so the
# file is valid both as sh and as make.
#
# Built and published by the odi-toolchain repository
# (https://github.com/AndreZiviani/odi-toolchain), from the tag in each
# reference; its README says how. To move a pin: tag a new version there,
# take the digest from the summary of the publish run, change it here, and
# rebuild -- the binaries should come out identical, or every difference
# should have a reason.
#
# uClibc-ng toolchain (binutils 2.47, gcc 16.2.0, uClibc-ng 1.0.59, /opt/oss)
OSS_IMAGE_PINNED=ghcr.io/andreziviani/odi-toolchain-uclibc:v2@sha256:5305427b3e87eb2e3f2416778e68cbbb46c3f8b3dfb1317b52eedad803115910
# freestanding toolchain (Debian gcc-mips-linux-gnu, qemu-mips-static)
DIAG_IMAGE_PINNED=ghcr.io/andreziviani/odi-toolchain-freestanding:v2@sha256:a0342d9662553d725b29be891d5647393f76768c7cf3decb34b4f4bb2e0de611
